<title>USA: USDA sets '97 cotton marketing assistance rates.</title>
<headline>USDA sets '97 cotton marketing assistance rates.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Tuesday said the 1997 marketing assistance loan rate for upland cotton was 51.92 cents per pound.</p>
<p>USDA's Commodity Credit Corp also said the 1997 marketing assistance loan rate for ELS cotton was 79.65 cents per pound.</p>
</text>
